              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mei a Nehemiya, muana wa Hakaleya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ngondo wa Kiseleu mu tshidimu tshia makumi abidi hanakadi mu Shushana, nsubu wa mukelenge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanani, umue wa bana betu, wakalua kundi ne bakuabo bakadi bafume nʼandi mu Yuda; nakabakonka bualu bua Bena Yuda bakadi bashale bakumuka mu buhika ne bua Yelushalema kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakangambila ne, Bantu bakumuka mu buhika mu buloba bukuabo badi bashalaku badi mu dikenga dikole, badi bafuishibua bundu; lumbu lua Yelushalema kabidi tutshidi hanshi, ne bibi bialu bidi bioshibua ne kahia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanakunvua mei â, nakashikama hanshi, nakadila, nakajinga matuku makuabo; nakajila bia kudia, nakatendelela ku mpala kua Nzambi wa mu diulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakamba ne, Ndi nkusengelela, Yehowa, Nzambi wa mu diulu, Nzambi munene ne wa ditshina, utu walama tshihungidi tshiandi ne luse luandi kudi badi bamunanga ne badi batumikila mikenji yandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "teleja matshu ebe, ubulule mesu ebe bua wewe unvue kulomba kua muntu webe kudiye ukulomba munya ne butuku bualu bua Bena Isalele bantu bebe, hantshidi ntonda mibi ya Bena Isalele yakukuenzelabo. Bulelela, meme ne ba mu nsubu wa tatu wanyi tuakuenza bibi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tuakukuenzela malu a bundu, katuakutumikila mikenji ne mei mafunda ne mei majadika biwakambila muntu webe Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi nkusengelela ne, Uvuluke dî diebe diwakambila muntu webe Mose ne, Binuenza malu mabi, nennumuangalashe munkatshi mua ba ha buloba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi binuakudimuna mitshima yenu kundi, binuatumikila mikenji yanyi bua kuyenza, binuikala bamuangalashibue kunfudilu kua diulu, nennusangisheku, nennuhingashe ku muaba unakusungula bua kujadikaku dina dianyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mbena mudimu bebe ne bantu bebe bawakahikula ku bukole buebe bunene ne ku tshianza tshiebe tshikole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge, ndi nkusengelela ne, Teleja matshu ebe ku kulomba kua muntu webe ne ku kulomba kua bantu bebe badi ne disanka bua kutshina dina diebe; ndi nkusengelela ne, Uhe muntu webe diakalengele lelu, umufile luse ku mesu kua muntu eu. (Bualu bua meme nakadi mutuadi wa luhanza lua mukelenge).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
